sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>Gateway
    participant ExtProc as ai-gateway-payload-processing<br/>ext_proc gRPC Service
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Provider as External LLM Provider<br/>(OpenAI / Anthropic / Azure / Vertex)

    Note over ExtProc,K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation Loop

    K8sAPI->>ExtProc: Watch ExternalProvider CRs
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create Service, ServiceEntry,<br/>DestinationRule
    K8sAPI->>ExtProc: Watch ExternalModel CRs
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(weighted traffic splitting)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Read Secrets<br/>(provider credentials)

    Note over Client,Provider: Request Flow (ext_proc)

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>or /v1/messages
    Envoy->>ExtProc: ext_proc: ProcessingRequest<br/>(gRPC)
    Note right of ExtProc: 1. Resolve model → provider(s)<br/>2. Apply weighted routing<br/>3. Translate API format<br/>(openai-chat ↔ messages)<br/>4. Inject provider credentials<br/>(apikey / sigv4 / oauth2)
    ExtProc-->>Envoy: ext_proc: ProcessingResponse<br/>(modified headers + body)
    Envoy->>Provider: Translated request<br/>with injected credentials
    Provider-->>Envoy: LLM Response
    Envoy->>ExtProc: ext_proc: Response processing
    ExtProc-->>Envoy: Translated response
    Envoy-->>Client: Response<br/>(original API format)

    Note over ExtProc,K8sAPI: Legacy Migration (conditional)

    K8sAPI->>ExtProc: Watch maas.opendatahub.io<br/>ExternalModel CRs
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create inference.opendatahub.io<br/>ExternalModel CRs
